 "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499312422_1426662262769612_6311685057863124741_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zT_2eTjudaQQ7kNvwEQgZpz&_nc_oc=AdoOlNeGcU57U7YLhhb9Svu8uQNrJtTQV2AdPUBZy36pPatYpDrRsE8rj8pwEQ0gBQU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOaOVOmIPLBGvM-CDL-EM4LHV_iZ_c795FuBTpz-mG_Jw&oe=6AE4A1DE"}, {"file_name": "logo-transparent.png", "id": "1161989966167586", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499312332_1161989969500919_329693315265702608_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6TIWfIfdoFEQ7kNvwFZDyvb&_nc_oc=AdosXigu35DOrBO-QHwV6fnJqOWUF0acAcv3pEOy0MkanKcWcaNMAGZTpdssk_b4lSg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMWEFq__R7aTInqluPv74HvmqOmb81HOkm--Pe6L4WatQ&oe=6AE4B86F"}]}, "id": "2061477637882752", "locale": "en_US", "screenshots": [{"file_name": "01.png", "id": "2907512559608947", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499312231_2907512562942280_4790508338452449229_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Q4coslXPCQgQ7kNvwEV6iBP&_nc_oc=AdpBzRdA5NKTJaHkFO9pB5SavWA5DHg3PBxZSpWXl6dtwH2YnjpVTRwv1xFfLD5MtwI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNA-ViAStzoDi7LoLmYftoToXBMVli6Igpy-KKQBnRgPg&oe=6AE4B43C"}, {"file_name": "02.png", "id": "1114877094450423", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499312267_1114877097783756_969857562965461489_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SqNUXCFxgj8Q7kNvwFiHoGZ&_nc_oc=AdrB4VT1fwMoKDn5T0PmRZ8bKJ_N1Sla6hPQZwFHL5eTydGk3YDRrdUXIhP85893DZM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOOBuOYzXODqVKeGkR1FWbnzhSNFbZNiQwcpOSW6ZuARg&oe=6AE4B0F5"}, {"file_name": "03.png", "id": "884131511361956", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499314659_884131514695289_5808890142641071213_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=WsdyxC5KeDUQ7kNvwGjGFTN&_nc_oc=AdpetYggTuAAkz1iG_W7ARIpCGjc9o7iNMWKqFP2Ty_-gfxhTKEg1iyKEJFbMDmL96M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNQmhoWZVhSPGZ-Rjo8r3nXEVzmaZA1bS-Lw8CkUX3vXQ&oe=6AE48F99"}, {"file_name": "04.png", "id": "2073705526623799", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499313063_2073705529957132_5967704642211820566_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Uk85oqi7MyQQ7kNvwGuOLsN&_nc_oc=AdrGe3p6QEYceZwufDcQijylhlcIm-xUV8xpgp7ugUTTxSP5AxPWRUR5M7kZlw82qs4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMWRxoaZoJCIF4BML351O9UqbZ1Hd0xp11vrFkAsbqufQ&oe=6AE4AC65"}, {"file_name": "05.png", "id": "1110048894841244", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/595119480_1110048898174577_7636723964820635014_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Aig3ZkcAemIQ7kNvwGkDARQ&_nc_oc=AdrXKvduY_QXt7ERh3LDxun7c4XmXKmrjejV16yxasEltDqg333bjbU-u4ErA07GW0E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMifOu3j8zZ4OR_XHKf_mtH5XeYB-32aqImKJg5NRHLNQ&oe=6AE4AA8E"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Immuch360", "keywords": ["360", "VR180", "3D", "video", "photo"], "long_description": "Your media. Any screen. Every perspective.\n\nPress 360\u00b0 on a 360\u00b0 photo or video and it is all around you: look around by turning your head. 3D files are in true 3D, VR180 fills a half sphere, and an Apple spatial photo floats in front of you in 3D. Flat photos and videos play in the window, and Rotate turns a sideways photo.\n\nSign in with your phone: the headset shows a code, you enter it in Immuch360 on your phone, and your Immich library opens in the headset.\n\nControls: the right thumbstick turns the view, the left one goes to the previous or next media, the trigger plays or pauses, A or X shows the panel (time bar, 3D, 360\u00b0/180\u00b0), B or Y goes back. Hands work too.\n\nYour files where they are, nothing copied: the headset's own photos and videos (\"Use without a server\", no account), SMB, WebDAV and DLNA shares, a phone or a computer shared on the Wi-Fi, a Plex Media Server without plex.tv, or your Immich server. Raw Insta360, GoPro MAX and DJI Osmo 360 files are stitched in the headset.\n\nGood to know: tested on a Quest 3. HEVC is the safe codec; H.264 stops around 4096x2304 on a Quest 3, and the app offers the server's transcoded stream when an original is too large.\n\nThe same app runs on phones, tablets, TVs and computers. Free and open source (GNU AGPL v3), no ads, no analytics, nothing sent to the developer.\n\nImmuch360 is an unofficial fork of the Immich mobile app, not affiliated with nor endorsed by Immich, FUTO, Plex, Meta, Apple, Insta360, GoPro or DJI.", "short_description": "Your photos and videos all around you: 360\u00b0, VR180 and true 3D, panoramas, and your flat photos and videos too. Played in place from the headset, a NAS, a media server, a Plex server, a phone or a computer at home, or your Immich server. Sign in with your phone: the headset shows a code to enter in Immuch360 on your phone. Raw 360\u00b0 camera files are stitched in the headset. Free and open source, no account needed."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://github.com/freeKC/Immuch360/blob/immuch360/PRIVACY.md", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "APROGSYS", "support_website_url": "https://github.com/freeKC/Immuch360/issues", "website_url": "https://github.com/freeKC/Immuch360", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "434961926215971"}, {"id": "393222478507326"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_proc